 big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious marinated antelope with brown beer is served here."},{"icon":"🍻","type":"inns","px":14,"x":199.46,"y":608.53,"cell":4262,"i":10,"name":"The Brave Inn","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious deep-fried potato with amber whisky is served here."},{"icon":"🍻","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1587.03,"y":422.35,"cell":2575,"i":11,"name":"The Fat Wolverine","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious stuffed pie with purple wine is served here."},{"icon":"🍻","type":"inns","px":14,"x":719.59,"y":583.59,"cell":4035,"i":12,"name":"The Distant Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dressed pudding with cold vodka is served here."},{"icon":"🍻","type":"inns","px":14,"x":478.19,"y":363.9,"cell":1932,"i":13,"name":"The Blue Leopard","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious fried beaver with grey absinthe is served here."},{"icon":"🍻","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1296.55,"y":467.65,"cell":2917,"i":14,"name":"The Blue Panther","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious marinated teal with cold nectar is served here."},{"icon":"🍻","type":"inns","px":14,"x":227.09,"y":558.89,"cell":3731,"i":15,"name":"The Old Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious syrupped mango with salty brandy is served here."},{"icon":"🍻","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1548.91,"y":587.41,"cell":4112,"i":16,"name":"The White Marten","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious poached hart with salty water is served here."},{"icon":"🍻","type":"inns","px":14,"x":452.11,"y":374.64,"cell":1930,"i":17,"name":"The Loud Beaver","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious jugged bread with white beer is served here."},{"icon":"🚨","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":1682.11,"y":687.47,"cell":5167,"i":18,"name":"Loksylan Lighthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"🚨","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":761.95,"y":311.25,"cell":1476,"i":19,"name":"Troysan Lighthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"🚨","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":734.6,"y":498.96,"cell":3248,"i":20,"name":"Karkilkut Lighthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"⚔️","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1464.28,"y":478.13,"cell":3052,"i":21,"name":"Vettanolo Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Rocanan Expedition. \r\nDate: August 5, 280 Lympsford Era."},{"icon":"⚔️","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":418.98,"y":694.96,"cell":5064,"i":22,"name":"Ititia Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Padamian Rebellion. \r\nDate: April 3, 436 Lympsford Era."},{"icon":"⚔️","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1403.66,"y":587.26,"cell":4099,"i":23,"name":"Fanone Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Fiuran War. \r\nDate: March 1, 436 Lympsford Era."},{"icon":"🗝️","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":1289,"y":796.5,"cell":5870,"i":24,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7531122105870\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7531122105870\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🗝️","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":1016.64,"y":715.81,"cell":5345,"i":25,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7531122105345\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7531122105345\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🗝️","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":765.41,"y":758.35,"cell":5648,"i":26,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7531122105648\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7531122105648\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🗝️","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":439.8,"y":674.26,"cell":4933,"i":27,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7531122104933\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7531122104933\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🐉","type":"lake-monsters","dy":48,"x":1237.23,"y":500.42,"cell":3285,"i":28,"name":"Nyirja Monster","note":"Whispers say a relic monster of 10 ft long inhabits Nyirja Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"🦑","type":"sea-monsters","x":204.19,"y":452.54,"cell":2717,"i":29,"name":"Seatondo Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 ft long."},{"icon":"🦑","type":"sea-monsters","x":160.2,"y":617.7,"cell":4259,"i":30,"name":"Blechwel Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 16 ft long."},{"icon":"👹","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":481.24,"y":558.49,"cell":3750,"i":31,"name":"Zierdi Vampire","note":"Whispers speak of a terrifying Vampire who inhabits Zierdi hills and terrorizes the region."},{"icon":"🌳","type":"sacred-forests","x":848.72,"y":598.95,"cell":4183,"i":32,"name":"Yekin Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Turchian Spirits."},{"icon":"🌳","type":"sacred-forests","x":1473.48,"y":491.7,"cell":3171,"i":33,"name":"Cinazagna Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Tallian Spirits."},{"icon":"🌲","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":287.65,"y":620.02,"cell":4394,"i":34,"name":"Zardavilbar Pinery","note":"A pinery sacred to local Alverenese Pantheon."},{"icon":"💰","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":527.69,"y":451.05,"cell":2744,"i":35,"name":"Andopepoiri Lions","note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"💰","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":238.18,"y":486.34,"cell":3088,"i":36,"name":"Armorealozo Leopards","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"💰","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1213.99,"y":597.08,"cell":4220,"i":37,"name":"Coviodure Rooks","note":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":662.9,"y":699.4,"cell":5087,"i":38,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":688.97,"y":354.19,"cell":1835,"i":39,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":187.4,"y":635.15,"cell":4505,"i":40,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":1023.1,"y":286.1,"cell":1121,"i":41,"name":"Dudbury Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳀⲴⳚ⳥ⳀⳄⳚⳒⳲⳒⳈⳂⲸⳃ⳪Ⳉ⳥ⳃⳎ ⳚⳢⳜⳄⳚⳃⳀⳃⳞⳞ ⳐⳒⳄⳊⲶ⳧ⳎⳲⲺⳃⳤⳆⳀⳠⳔⲴⳎ⳧ⲲⲴⳤⲼⳊⲴⳭⲼⲲⳈⳐ ⲶⳖⲴ⳪ⲼⳤⳎⳔⳲ⳪⳧ⳤ⳾ⳘⳄ⳪ⳐⲲⳌ⳧Ⲿ ⳩⳧Ⳁ⳪ⳄⳌⲺⳠⳔⲾ⳹</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":190.87,"y":559.99,"cell":3726,"i":42,"name":"Temblane Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1b𐠥\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802 \udc21\udc31\ud802𐠅\udc0d\udc3c \udc28\udc34\udc2a\ud802𐠴𐠼\ud802𐠌\udc15\udc1c𐠖\udc33\ud802𐠚 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠞𐠢\udc10\ud802𐠚\udc19\udc26𐠁𐠦\udc2c𐠸𐠷\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":1213.98,"y":534.7,"cell":3549,"i":43,"name":"Tolyhad Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༧༨༴༻༑༄༅༇༫༆༄༨༙༢༽༠༴༬༢༤༡༒༔༁༪༽༥༹༦༥༵༆༼༼༊༃་༚༯༱༙༔༛༈༯༲༿༫༶༇༦༳༦༜༛༗༪༈༬༿༿༇༨ༀ༲༨༮༧༖༆༑༩༱ༀ</div>"},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":1510.15,"y":697.34,"cell":5153,"i":44,"name":"Ruined Temple","note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":845.63,"y":603.59,"cell":4182,"i":45,"name":"Ruined Fortress","note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":1630.84,"y":274.94,"cell":1178,"i":46,"name":"Ruined Town","note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":1527.12,"y":421.48,"cell":2570,"i":47,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"📚","type":"libraries","x":1004.61,"y":610.61,"cell":4324,"i":48,"name":"Totford Library","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"🎪","type":"circuses","x":911.1,"y":658.4,"cell":4698,"i":49,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"🎪","type":"circuses","x":1536.58,"y":285.23,"cell":1290,"i":50,"name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"🤺","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":1543.63,"y":590.64,"cell":4110,"i":51,"name":"Torva Contest","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a contest of brutality in Torva, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"🎠","type":"fairs","x":1358.98,"y":650.73,"cell":4738,"i":52,"name":"Aegivorum Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Aegivorum, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"icon":"🛶","type":"canoes","x":1351.82,"y":153.66,"cell":330,"i":53,"name":"Minor Jetty","note":"A small location along the Hatham River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"🐗","type":"migration","x":1198.08,"y":113.36,"cell":130,"i":54,"name":"Ravens migration","note":"A huge group of ravens are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"🦇","type":"caves","x":301.6,"y":588.63,"cell":4004,"i":55,"name":"Trelmadir Cavern","note":"The Trelmadir Cavern. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"🪦","type":"necropolises","x":1471.55,"y":90.03,"cell":65,"i":56,"name":"Midley Necropolis","note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":195.48,"y":598.03,"cell":4134,"i":57,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4134\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":705.89,"y":657.14,"cell":4682,"i":58,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4682\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":566.96,"y":312.42,"cell":1455,"i":59,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1455\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":1274.63,"y":361.07,"cell":1871,"i":60,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1871\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":1320.51,"y":546.4,"cell":3687,"i":61,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deoru